      "t": "h3",
      "text": "SS (Stainless Steel) Rotary Gear Pump"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "At Rotozest, we are proud to offer high-quality Stainless Steel (SS) rotary gear pumps that deliver precision, durability, and efficiency across various industrial applications. Our SS rotary gear pumps are engineered with top-grade stainless steel, making them ideal for handling corrosive and sensitive fluids, ensuring long-lasting performance in demanding environments. Whether you are in the chemical industry, food processing, or pharmaceuticals, our stainless steel gear pumps offer the reliability and corrosion resistance you need for efficient fluid transfer.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "What is an SS Rotary Gear Pump?"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "An SS rotary gear pump is a positive displacement pump that uses the meshing of gears to move fluids from the inlet to the outlet. The stainless steel construction provides superior resistance to corrosion and wear, making these pumps perfect for industries handling aggressive chemicals, food-grade materials, and other sensitive fluids. The pump works by trapping fluid in the cavities between the gear teeth and transferring it smoothly through the system, ensuring steady and reliable flow, even with high-viscosity liquids.",
      "html": null
    },
